<title>UK: Smithkline Beecham sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Smithkline Beecham sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SMITHKLINE BEECHAM CAPITAL PLC</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    13.NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10 GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
